<h2>No account matches</h2>
<% if @missing_id %>
  <p>No account has id <code><%= @missing_id %></code>. It was never issued, or the account has been deleted.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>Nothing matches <code><%= @query %></code>. The lookup is an exact match on email and then
    <code>external_id</code>; a lookup that could not reach the authdb also lands here.</p>
<% end %>
<p><a href="/account">Try another lookup</a></p>
